                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]      ⚖️  MATCHING EXPECTATION:[/h1] \n* 🟢 = Available = Fun +1\n* 🔴 = Not Available = Fun -1\n* Match Nothing = 0 Fun\n\n🟢 Fun Shooting \n🟢 Fixed Linear Difficulty\n🟢 Non-Stop Dodging Thousand of Bullets\n🟢 Online Coop / Local Splitscreen\n🟢 Inventory Management \n🔴 Optional Auto Fire / Aim\n🔴 Optional Mouse Control Movement\n🔴 Slow Motion Ability\n🔴 More Grindy More Powerful\n🔴 Beat Hi-Score for replay value\n\n[table]\n    [tr]\n        [th]fMeter[/th]\n        [th]FUN[/th]\n        [th]fUN METER[/th]\n        [th]DISCOUNT[/th]\n [th]COMMUNITY[/th]\n        [th]REVIEWER[/th]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [th]A+[/th]\n        [td]5[/td]\n        [td]Loving it [/td]\n        [td]No Wait[/td]\n        [td] -[/td]\n        [td] -[/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [th]A[/th]\n        [td]4[/td]\n        [td]Liked it[/td]\n        [td]No Wait[/td]\n        [td] -[/td]\n        [td] -[/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [th]B[/th]\n        [td]2-3[/td]\n        [td]Half satisfied[/td]\n        [td]Wait 50%[/td]\n        [td] ✔[/td]\n        [td] ✔[/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [th]C[/th]\n        [td] 1[/td]\n        [td]Less interested[/td]\n        [td]Wait 75%[/td]\n        [td] -[/td]\n        [td] -[/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [th]D[/th]\n        [td] 0[/td]\n        [td]Not what you need[/td]\n        [td]Wait 100%[/td]\n        [td] -[/td]\n        [td] -[/td]\n    [/tr]\n[/table]\n\n🏅 Community Rating: [b] Mixed [/b]\n⚖️ [b]fMeter {B-}[/b] Worth a play, if you enjoy Coop with Inventory Management. However, if you're looking for Optional Auto Fire / Aim, don't play it\n\n🔎 Check the full list for your preferred gameplay 👇 [u][i]https://steamcommunity.com/groups/expectationchecklist/discussions/1/580551263528239050/[/i][/u]\n\n[h1] 🕘          IMPRESSION:[/h1]\n* Year 2017: Game released\n* Year 2026: Started playtest for the first time :)\n* 2 hours later: Fun game :D\n* 4 hours later: Repeating Mission 12 is too stress for Casual player\n\n[h1]  🔊         TESTER MUST KNOW:[/h1]\n* Arena = Solo 1 life challenge from zero progress\n* Blue Prints = New ship parts for better performance\n* Blue Prints will not available if player not able to beat the new mission\n* No Blue Prints = No upgrades \n* No upgrade = Meaningless Grinding\n* Meaningless Grinding = Cannot beat the new mission\n* Cannot beat the new mission = No Blue Print, and repeat\n\n[h1] 💎  SAME GENRE COMPARISON:[/h1]\n* Solo campaign available, but not focus on story\n* Ship loadout mix and match parts (Eg. Weapon Slots, Shield Reactor, Engine)\n* Shield will regenerate it self\n* No health recover until the end of mission\n* Give no chance for Shield Regenerate if playing solo\n* Total of 50 mission\n\n[h1]  ⚠️        RUMOR CHECKING:[/h1]\n* A lot of weapon option ➜ Not happening if you still under mission 13 \n* Lots of weapon customization ➜ Not happening if you still under mission 13 \n* Difficulty unbalanced ➜ Agree, make people think that require grinding, but in fact is useless\n* Too much visual clutter ➜ Agree, we are consistently dodging thousand of mini bullets\n* Coop play is the only way to progress ➜ Mean that solo player is not welcome\n\n[quote]\n[b]Remember  to 👍 for me if you liked this review:[/b]\n🔔 More similar reviews ➜ [u][url=http://store.steampowered.com/curator/31940448-Expectation-Checklist/]Browse Here[/url][/u] and follow this Curator, or\n🤝 Visit Our Gaming Discussion ➜ [u] [url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/expectationchecklist]We're Here[/url][/u]\n📢 Disclaimer regarding Short Hours & English Errors ➜ [u][url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/expectationchecklist/discussions/0/4594180031254224809/]Read Here[/url][/u]\n[/quote]",
